  "Header": "MMC-CPS-V2.5",
  "APIProfile": "Basic",
  "Description": "Conversation with Personal Status (slide 8 of the MMC Reference Models): a conversation with a machine that takes the personal status of the person into account. Visual Scene Description and Speech Scene Description describe what the camera shows and what the person says, Visual Object Identification gives the Instance Identifier of the object the person indicates, Automatic Speech Recognition and Natural Language Understanding take what the person says (the Text Descriptors Object is the former Meaning), Personal Status Extraction gives the personal status of the person, Entity Dialogue Processing the answer and the Personal Status of the machine, and Portable Avatar Multiplexing the Portable Avatar, which needs the ID of the machine.",
